DESCRIPTION:https://sf.funcheap.com/cal-football-wagner-free-train-concert
 -game/\nLocation: san francisco\nPrice: Free\nCategories: concert\, free\n
 Source: funcheap/san-francisco\n\nGrammy-winning pop band Train will enter
  Bear Territory this Saturday\, September 19th at 12:30pm to perform at a 
 Cal football game. UC Berkeley officials said the Bay Area band will serve
  as the Golden Bears’ special in-game engagement and postgame entertainm
 ent during the game against Wagner on Saturday\, Sept. 19. The game\, whic
 h will take place during “Rooted in the Bay Day\,” a day that celebrat
 es Bay Area community and culture\, is scheduled for 12:30 p.m. “Whether
  you’re singing along to ‘Save Me San Francisco’ or cheering for a t
 ouchdown\, you won’t wanna miss a single thing we do\,” university off
 icials said in a statement on Thursday.
LOCATION:san francisco
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/cal-football-wagner-free-train-concert-game/
END:VEVENT
